mode prove
triangle A B C
midpoint M B C
midpoint N B M
midpoint D A B

# Centers through the fixed chord AB share its perpendicular bisector.
circumcenter O1 A B C
circumcenter O2 A B M
circumcenter O3 A B N
orthocenter H4 A B O1
prove_collinear O1 O2 O3 D H4

# Since B, M, and C share a carrier, these orthocenters share the altitude
# through A perpendicular to that carrier.
orthocenter H1 A B C
orthocenter H2 A B M
orthocenter H3 A M C
prove_collinear H1 H2 H3
